<main id="main">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span>Privacy</span></p>
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="lede">MathNex does not require accounts and does not use advertising trackers. Personal details are only collected when you use the contact form.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose narrow-prose">
      <p>Contact messages store your name, email address, subject, message text, and the time of submission in <code>data/inbox.json</code> so we can reply. This information is not sold or displayed publicly.</p>
      <p>If you prefer not to use the form, email us using the address in the footer.</p>
      <p>AI Marker uploads are stored temporarily for the marking request and then deleted. They are not retained as a student archive.</p>
      <p>Library files are held under <code>Exam Boards</code> (and optionally <code>public/papers</code>). Only upload content you have the right to host.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
<%- include("partials/footer") %>
